HolyHammer prover installations
================================

This directory contains no prover invocation scripts.  It may hold local,
untracked prover installations using the version-directory layout:

    e-<version>/<platform>/eprover
    vampire-<version>/<platform>/vampire
    zipperposition-<version>/<platform>/zipperposition
    z3-<version>/<platform>/z3

`<platform>` is such as `arm64-linux` or `x86_64-darwin`.  When several
versions are installed, HolyHammer chooses the newest version directory.
Do not commit downloaded prover binaries.

The recommended user-wide installation is performed by
`tools/download-provers`.  It installs under
`$HOME/.hol4/hammer/provers` instead.  A supported binary on `PATH`, an
explicit configuration entry, or a dedicated prover environment variable
may also be used; see `../README`.
